NOTE ON DATA (not covered by this license)

This repository contains CODE ONLY. It ships no scriptural, literary, or
reference texts. Each builder script downloads its corpus from the original
source at build time, on the user's own machine. Those corpora keep their own
licenses, which the tools surface with every result. In particular:

  • Public domain — Project Gutenberg, 1 Enoch/Jubilees (R.H. Charles),
    Brenton LXX, KJV, Lewis & Short*, BDB/Jastrow/Lane lexicons.
  • CC BY / CC BY-SA — Pleiades, Duke Databank of Documentary Papyri,
    Perseus canonical texts, Beta Masaheft Ge'ez, Wikipedia.
  • CC BY-NC (personal research only — do NOT redistribute/resell) —
    the Sefaria layers of the Tanakh, Talmud, and Mishnah.
  • Verify before republishing — WikiSpooks.

The MIT license above applies to the code in this repository, not to any
downloaded text. Respect each corpus's license.
